      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.boh_isaac.amelineau_ed:1-19",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲩⲱ ⲛⲉϥϣⲗⲏⲗ ⲉϫⲙⲡ**ⲟⲩⲁ** ⲡⲟⲩⲁ ⲙⲙⲟⲟⲩ ·",
      "english": "And he prayed over each one of them.",
      "source": "Dormition of John MERC.AD in Budge ed.",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:misc.dormition_john.budge",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲉⲧⲁϥϭⲟϫⲓ ⲛϫⲉ**ⲟⲩⲁⲓ** ⲁϥⲙⲁϩⲟⲩⲥⲫⲟⲅⲅⲟⲥ ⲛϩⲉⲙϫ ⲁϥⲧⲁⲗⲟϥ ⲉϫⲉⲛⲟⲩⲕⲁϣ ⲁϥⲧⲥⲟϥ ⲉϥϫⲱ ⲙⲙⲟⲥ ϫⲉⲭⲁϥ ⲛⲧⲉⲛⲛⲁⲩ ϫⲉⲏⲗⲓⲁⲥ ⲛⲏⲟⲩ ⲛⲧⲉϥⲉⲛϥ ⲉϧⲣⲏⲓ .",
      "english": "One ran, and filling a sponge full of vinegar, put it on a reed, and gave it to him to drink, saying, 'Let him be. Let's see whether Elijah comes to take him down.'",
      "source": "Bohairic Gospel of Mark 15 (Digital Edition)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:15",
